# it completed. Malduc's 1001, option 20: begun (YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION); Malduc then says EXTENDED_MISSION_OFFSET +
# 10. Status 0: Iron Eater 767 (option 0: status 1; the door _6ld and Iron Eater's own 604 otherwise). Quicksand Caves:
# qm4 says its own text at status 1; qm6 with none up spawns Centurio, Triarius and Princeps (claimed) and says
# SENSE_OF_FOREBODING; the GM effects keep the char up; each death reads the other two (dead or not spawned): the last
# sets status 2. qm6 11 (status 3), qm4 10 (status 4); Iron Eater 768 completes the mission (1133 rank points).
